<p class="caps">Styling Services are provided by independent Stylists, not by armoires. armoires does not vet, endorse, or guarantee any Stylist, any Client, or any outcome, and makes no warranty that Styling Services will be satisfactory, suitable, safe, or fit for any purpose.</p>
<p>Styling is <strong>subjective opinion and taste</strong>, not professional advice. The general disclaimers in the Terms also apply.</p>

